    "detailed_description": "<strong>hoptix</strong> is a movement playground game inspired by classic speed platformers, arcade skateboarding games, and platform fighters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Responsive, expressive movement:</strong> Use a variety of movement techniques, from walljumps to doublejumps to railgrinds to airdodges to traverse levels your way. Stop on a dime at any speed. <br></li><li><strong>Wavedashing:</strong> We have it.<br></li><li><strong>Built-in Gif camera:</strong> Easily record your gameplay in-game and generate a social media-friendly .gif file. Show off to your friends with no hassle!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544100/extras/09da8356be9c11acd1afe56ac8522e35.poster.avif?t=1748898278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544100/extras/09da8356be9c11acd1afe56ac8522e35.webm?t=1748898278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544100/extras/09da8356be9c11acd1afe56ac8522e35.mp4?t=1748898278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>hoptix</strong> is a bit more like a walking simulator, or the free roam mode of an arcade skateboarding game, than a traditional platformer. It's all about exploring, racing, and stunting through exciting, but peaceful environments at your own pace. It's also very easy and beginner-friendly to clear any level, and has no enemies or &quot;death pits.&quot; hoptix doesn't want anything getting between you and the way you want to play, and invites you to find your own challenges and goals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >hoptix is for people who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>enjoy other momentum-based platformers<br></li><li>are intrinsically motivated by movement and style<br></li><li>have thoughts like &quot;Can I get through this room without touching the ground?&quot;</li></ul><br>hoptix is a very short game, with a single playthrough only having a runtime of about an hour, however it's a game that's meant to be replayed! Each level features multiple different routes and many opportunities to express your own personal style through its movement mechanics and obstacles.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>hoptix</strong> is a movement playground game inspired by classic speed platformers, arcade skateboarding games, and platform fighters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Responsive, expressive movement:</strong> Use a variety of movement techniques, from walljumps to doublejumps to railgrinds to airdodges to traverse levels your way. Stop on a dime at any speed. <br></li><li><strong>Wavedashing:</strong> We have it.<br></li><li><strong>Built-in Gif camera:</strong> Easily record your gameplay in-game and generate a social media-friendly .gif file. Show off to your friends with no hassle!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544100/extras/09da8356be9c11acd1afe56ac8522e35.poster.avif?t=1748898278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544100/extras/09da8356be9c11acd1afe56ac8522e35.webm?t=1748898278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544100/extras/09da8356be9c11acd1afe56ac8522e35.mp4?t=1748898278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>hoptix</strong> is a bit more like a walking simulator, or the free roam mode of an arcade skateboarding game, than a traditional platformer. It's all about exploring, racing, and stunting through exciting, but peaceful environments at your own pace. It's also very easy and beginner-friendly to clear any level, and has no enemies or &quot;death pits.&quot; hoptix doesn't want anything getting between you and the way you want to play, and invites you to find your own challenges and goals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >hoptix is for people who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>enjoy other momentum-based platformers<br></li><li>are intrinsically motivated by movement and style<br></li><li>have thoughts like &quot;Can I get through this room without touching the ground?&quot;</li></ul><br>hoptix is a very short game, with a single playthrough only having a runtime of about an hour, however it's a game that's meant to be replayed! Each level features multiple different routes and many opportunities to express your own personal style through its movement mechanics and obstacles.",
    "short_description": "hoptix is a movement playground game where style and speed come easy! Play as Rocket, a cyborg rabbit who is as cute as they are radical. Explore, race, and stunt on rollercoasters and skateparks in idyllic spaces. Share footage of your movement style with your friends.",
